{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《女神配對計劃 2》愈玩愈激！在本周日（15日）播出的最新一集，節目組竟安排女神與求愛勇者在主題公園海洋館過夜，更會上演最真情對談。最令人期待的是，一眾女神將會激罕在鏡頭前展現素顏，究竟她們的真面目會否嚇親人？\n</p>\n<h2>女神勇者海洋館過夜 玻璃水世界前真情對談</h2>\n<p>隨著節目進入白熱化階段，只剩下6女10男進行配對。在新一集，眾人將在「單對單約會」中，零保留揭示內心最脆弱的痛點。為了增加浪漫氛圍，節目組將過夜地點鎖定於主題公園海洋館，安排他們對著寧靜的「玻璃水世界」談心，增進彼此認識，整個畫面極度唯美粉紅！在如此浪漫的環境下，各人的配對情況依然暗湧處處，相信將會迎來最新高潮，令觀眾期待值爆燈！</p>\n<h2>Amber Roxanne素顏上陣 小雲眼鏡Look勁可愛</h2>\n<p>今集的最大亮點，莫過於一眾女神將會首次在鏡頭前展現素顏一面！在海洋館過夜期間，女神們都會卸下華麗妝容，以最真實的面貌示人。當中陳若思（Amber）與何沛珈（Roxanne）更不約而同以可愛的「小雲眼鏡 Look」上陣，展現出與平時截然不同的一面，率性又貼地。究竟哪位女神的素顏最令人驚艷，就要密切留意節目播出！</p>\n<h2>網民期待女神素顏「終於見到真面目」</h2>\n<p>節目預告一出，網民對海洋館過夜的安排大感驚喜，更對女神們的素顏環節表示極度期待。不少網民留言表示：「海洋館過夜？TVB今次好大手筆！」、「好想睇郭珮文（Juliana）素顏係咩樣！」、「Amber個小雲眼鏡look肯定好得意！」、「喺水族館前面傾偈，諗起都覺得好浪漫」、「終於唔使化行妝，可以睇下佢哋最真實一面，期待！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_3119764826af5643e30d55.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_3119764826af5643e30d55.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_16667942756af564416f04c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_16667942756af564416f04c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_14823706af56432b08e4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_14823706af56432b08e4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_10011005596af5643691a49.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_10011005596af5643691a49.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_20552876976af56444de275.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_20552876976af56444de275.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:24:01.626711+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":932,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T09:05:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T09:17:26.565422+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T09:17:26.565422+00:00","content_hash":"c76841ad20781dd4edc7e0448e674823f02b1b2cb319f08c247c48027e958072","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}